      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} \n\nUnfortunately other than just uploading an update to an avatar (with or without any changes being made) and flipping a coin, there's not really any distinct method for reproducing the bug, other users were reporting the same exact issue of \"menus being deleted/missing\", parameters seemed to function more often than not (didn't think to check avatar debug till after posting), but menus were about a 15% chance of working per upload, to complicate the issue further, it seemed that most users were seeing the the avatar with proper parameters & menus, while other users weren't, leading me to think that, 1. they somehow downloaded an incorrect/outdated version of the avatar, or 2. that the problem might not be the sdk itself, but the avatar initialization.\n\nAnimator controllers, default menu elements, and default parameters were consistently unaffected.\n\nIt should also be noted that \"older\" avatars were also infrequently being affected, with missing menus and/or defaulting to an error bot, though reloading the avatar a couple times fixes the issue. (edit, meaning an unusual amount of errors in a time span)\n\nso... I'm not quite sure now if it's an sdk, game, or server bug :/",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
